"ref-11\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary\">../batch09/58-df-elementary</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit}\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit}\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}\\)</span> (transitive-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> (set cardinality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyApproachableChain}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyApproachableChain}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (internally-approachable-chain predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}internally\\text{-}approachable\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyApproachableChain}_S(M,C,\\delta,\\theta,\\mathfrak H,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\delta&lt;\\theta\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak H,\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak H)=\\{z\\in V:|\\mathrm{TC}(\\{z\\})|&lt;\\theta\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(C(i),\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(C(i),\\mathfrak H,\\mathcal L)\\land\n|\\mathrm{Univ}(C(i))|&lt;\\delta\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in\\delta\\;(i\\in j\\to\\mathrm{Univ}(C(i))\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(C(j)))\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\\to\\mathrm{Univ}(C(\\lambda))=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\lambda}\\mathrm{Univ}(C(i))\\Bigr)\\land\nM=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\delta}\\mathrm{Univ}(C(i))\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\delta\\;(j+1\\in\\delta\\to C\\upharpoonright j\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(C(j+1)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}internally\\text{-}approachable\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyApproachableChain}_S(M,C,\\delta,\\theta,\\mathfrak H,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\delta&lt;\\theta\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak H,\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak H)=\\{z\\in V:|\\mathrm{TC}(\\{z\\})|&lt;\\theta\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(C(i),\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(C(i),\\mathfrak H,\\mathcal L)\\land\n|\\mathrm{Univ}(C(i))|&lt;\\delta\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in\\delta\\;(i\\in j\\to\\mathrm{Univ}(C(i))\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(C(j)))\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\\to\\mathrm{Univ}(C(\\lambda))=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\lambda}\\mathrm{Univ}(C(i))\\Bigr)\\land\nM=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\delta}\\mathrm{Univ}(C(i))\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\delta\\;(j+1\\in\\delta\\to C\\upharpoonright j\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(C(j+1)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak H\">\\(\\mathfrak H\\)</span> has carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span>; every chain entry is now a genuine structure in that same language rather than an unexplained ordered pair.</li>\n<li>Continuity and internal approachability are stated on the underlying carriers, while the initial chain itself is required to belong to the next carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-elementary]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp